            "type": "text",
            "x": 34,
            "y": 63,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 320,
            "text": "### Travel guide · Overview (Page)\n\nSeven cities, two weeks A photo journey by train and two flights. Every city has its own page with places, times and tips; the travel diary records how it re…\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://list/d411bd5f5821438aa7f295596e739723`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "page:8b9f07fbdd7044cfa4ab3b59dde01d5d",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 34,
            "y": 355,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 177,
            "text": "### Evening round · Open questions (Note)\n\nEvening after coming home The journey is over, the selection begins. Out of roughly 230 pictures, 14 should go into the travel book. • Two pictures per city…\n\nLabels: `Photo`\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://list/8b9f07fbdd7044cfa4ab3b59dde01d5d`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "245b17584df74488a5495df763da7826",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 390,
            "y": 64,
            "width": 312,
            "height": 470,
            "text": "### [ ] Choose photos for the travel book\n⚑⚑ hoch · Planned day: 24.11.2026, 09:00 · Due: 24.11.2026, 11:00 · List: Travel plan\n\nChoose two pictures per city that tell a small story together.\n\n- [x] Raw files backed up\n- [x] First selection marked with stars\n- [ ] Second round: check black and white\n\nLabels: `Photo`, `Approval`\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://item/245b17584df74488a5495df763da7826`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "e80b49e8875f453f9b7f9e39410bec31",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 735,
            "y": 58,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 374,
            "text": "### [ ] Write the captions\n⚑ mittel · Planned day: 24.11.2026, 11:00 · Due: 25.11.2026 · List: Travel plan\n\nShort, with place and moment. No camera data in the caption.\n\nLabels: `Photo`\nAttachments: 2\n\nReference: `glide://item/e80b49e8875f453f9b7f9e39410bec31`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "page:b7e794b339c946b58f6c0ea642ad141e",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 735,
            "y": 470,
            "width": 187,
            "height": 229,
            "text": "### Travel stamp · Light cycle (Drawing)\n\nA travel stamp with four sky colours from morning to night, a PNG reference and a 16-pixel icon.\nAttachments: 2\n\nReference: `glide://list/b7e794b339c946b58f6c0ea642ad141e`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        }
